    "content": "Title: Full-Service Surrogacy Agency | ConceiveAbilities\n\nContent: The leading surrogacy agency ConceiveAbilities believes that everyone who wants to become a parent, can. Our full-service surrogacy agency has helped surrogates, intended parents, and egg donors build families for 30 years. Be a surrogateBe a parentBe an egg donorWhy ConceiveAbilities? 56% of our surrogates want to do another surrogacy journey because of their outstanding experience with our agency. 80% of our applicants are referrals from satisfied surrogates, intended parents, clinics, or other partners. 50% of staff are experienced surrogates, intended parents, egg donors or participants in assisted reproductive technology. We Help You Pursue Parenthood At ConceiveAbilities® we believe that everyone who wants to become a parent, can. Family-building is a beautiful experience, and our full-service egg donor and surrogate agency has helped build thousands of families for 30 years. Whether you are an intended parent ready to fulfill your family destiny, a surrogate answering your calling or an egg donor wanting to expand what’s possible in your life – We are your people. We’re growing with our families Since 1996, the ConceiveAbilities team has offered the best in reproductive technology. We have successfully managed thousands of pregnancies with individuals and couples seeking to create their families with egg donors and surrogates. Our egg donation and surrogacy center focuses on the mission that matching matters; the knowledge that we are making a difference in the creation of families with StandOut Surrogates and the best and brightest egg donors; a desire to help fulfill family destinies; and our commitment to growth through serving families around the globe. More on Intended ParentsOur surrogacy agency offers sisterhood We are committed to maintaining an elite surrogate network. Part of that commitment includes cultivating an open and compassionate environment for our surrogates and their families before, during and after the pregnancy. We are proud of our surrogacy program and surrogate community. And it grows as we welcome new members each month. Some have chosen to be a part of two and three pregnancies with us. Join this elite sisterhood that one surrogate refers to as being part of the lucky people. When it comes to your surrogacy journey, we want to give you peace of mind. We are here for you every step of the way. More on SurrogatesThe Best and the Brightest Donors The best and brightest egg donors deserve the best support and resources. We at ConceiveAbilities understand what a generous and meaningful gift you give when you become an egg donor, and we are all committed to making the experience as positive and rewarding as possible. No other agency offers our depth of professional and personal experience or works as closely with both donors and intended parents. No other agency staff is as highly qualified and deeply committed. More on Egg DonorsComprehensive Surrogacy Packages Our program offers personalized support and the highest compensation for our surrogates. We provide a dedicated team of experts, generous pay, and helpful resources, ensuring you feel calm and prepared through every stage of the process. More on CompensationSay Yes to A Life-Changing Experience “Thank you to ConceiveAbilities for being such an amazing support for myself and my family, for making a wonderful match and for caring about all of the gestational surrogates as if they were your own family. This experience has been one that has changed me as a person, mother, friend and wife.“ Tisha Surrogate Quick, Quality Surrogate and Parent Matching Thousands of families have chosen the ConceiveAbilities egg donor and surrogate agency because of our values, our numerous years of experience and our incredible staff. But more than anything, they recommend our company because of our matches. Our Matching Matters® approach is centered on personalization as well as the prioritization of a perfect match between surrogates, donors and parents. We get it right on the first introduction – nearly every time. See How Matching MattersMatching Matters®Makes Dreams Come True “I can’t imagine a better surrogate! The matching process was very well done.” LucyIntended ParentExpert Guidance Through Your Surrogacy Journey Our match manager was awesome. She guided us through the process of understanding and educated us on the things we didn’t even know we would want in a surrogate. Ethan & Jackson Intended Parents Some of Our Satisfied Customers We have a 4.6 star rating on Google. Related Blog Posts Everything You Need To Know About SurrogacyNovember 3rd, 2021Surrogacy is rapidly growing as a way to grow families. In 2019, surrogates were part of 5.4% of all in vitro fertilization (IVF) procedures in 2019. Why? It is the most successful treatment for infertility, with a 75% success rate. That number can increase as high as 95% for a birth once the gestational carrier is pregnant.Read More about Everything You Need To Know About SurrogacyPreparing for the Cost of SurrogacyDecember 12th, 2016You’ve done your research, talked to your doctor, and finally decided that surrogacy is the right choice for you. The next question you might have is also one of the most common: “How much does surrogacy cost?Read More about Preparing for the Cost of SurrogacyConceiveAbilities Launches All-In Surrogate Care and Compensation Package!June 22nd, 2021Our surrogates tell you in their own words why they became a surrogate. And, if you have been thinking about becoming a surrogate, today may be the right time to begin your surrogacy journey. Post pandemic, intended parents, who have dreamt of building their family through surrogacy, are ready to take the next step. Now more than ever, surrogates are needed. If surrogacy is something that might fuel your purpose, we are here to help you learn about and answer that calling.Read More about ConceiveAbilities Launches All-In Surrogate Care and Compensation Package!",
    "source": "https://www.conceiveabilities.com/"
  },
